    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8306" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circum-sŏnus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>sounding all around.</i> * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>filling with sounds</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turba canum,</span>”
				<i>barking around</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					4, 723</span></i>
