        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Pass.</i>, <i>filled with sounds</i>,
				<i>resounding around</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thisbe avibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 7, 261</span></i>
			.</div>
